Not. It is not the case that the whole point of lujvo is that someone
should be able to dissect them and figure out what you mean. The
whole point of lujvo is that they are words formed from parts that
have independent meaning within Lojban, but with a meaning that is
not equivalent to the sum of their parts. Their dissectablity is not
their point.

